Package: spotsepsisstage2
Title: Spot Sepsis Stage 2 Reproducibility Package
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Luke", "Rhodes", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Reproduces the analyses, tables, figures, and fixed prediction
    models reported in the Spot Sepsis Stage 2 manuscript. Restricted study
    data are supplied locally by authorized researchers and are never included.
